    life: b("It is oviparous. Females place clutches of two spherical eggs in leaf litter around the start of Madagascar's rainy season, approximately month 11 (November). Reported lifespan reaches about 15 years in human care; wild longevity is unknown.", "它为卵生。雌性约在马达加斯加雨季开始的11月，把每窝两枚球形卵产于落叶层中。圈养寿命记录可达约15年，野外寿命未知。"),
    adaptations: [
      adaptation("Dead-leaf tail", "枯叶状尾", "Flattening, vein-like ridges and irregular notches reproduce damaged leaf edges.", "扁平形态、叶脉状棱和不规则缺口模仿受损叶缘。"),
      adaptation("Variable mottling", "多变斑驳", "Brown, gray and rust color forms match different dead leaves and bark.", "棕、灰和锈红等色型可匹配不同枯叶与树皮。"),
      adaptation("Threat display", "威吓展示", "When camouflage fails it can open a bright red mouth and cry at approaching predators.", "伪装失效时，它会张开鲜红口腔并发声威吓靠近的捕食者。"),
    ],
    role: b("As a small nocturnal invertebrate predator, it transfers energy from forest-floor and shrub arthropods to snakes, birds and other predators. Its dependence on intact humid understory ties it to forest condition.", "作为小型夜行无脊椎动物捕食者，它把林地表层和灌丛节肢动物的能量传递给蛇、鸟等捕食者；对完整湿润林下层的依赖使其与森林状况紧密相连。"),
    threats: b("Currently assessed as Least Concern, but its future depends on eastern Madagascar rainforest remaining intact. Habitat loss and illegal or poorly controlled pet collection are continuing management concerns; population trend is uncertain.", "目前评估为无危，但其未来取决于马达加斯加东部雨林能否保持完整。生境丧失以及非法或管理不善的宠物采集仍是持续问题；种群趋势不确定。"),
    actions: b("Protect humid forest and understory, enforce wildlife-trade rules, verify legal captive origin and never release captive geckos. Monitoring should retain exact locality while protecting sensitive collection sites.", "应保护湿润森林及林下层，执行野生动物贸易法规，核实圈养来源合法性，且绝不放生圈养壁虎。监测需保留精确地点，同时保护敏感采集地。"),
    identify: b("Small leaf-tailed gecko with a broad leaf-shaped tail, apparent bite-like edge notches, horn-like scales above the eyes and mottled dead-leaf coloration.", "小型叶尾壁虎，尾宽而像叶片，边缘有仿佛虫咬的缺口，眼上有角状尖鳞，整体呈枯叶般斑驳色。"),
    similar: b("Uroplatus ebenaui has a shorter, less leaf-like tail and closely overlaps in appearance. Species-level photos should show the characteristic broad ragged leaf tail or carry expert identification and locality metadata.", "埃本氏叶尾壁虎的尾更短、叶状程度较弱，外形却高度相近。物种级照片应清楚显示宽而破叶状的特征尾，或具有专家鉴定和地点元数据。"),
    senses: b("Large eyes with vertical pupils suit dim forest light. Communication is poorly known; a wide red-mouth display and loud cry are used when threatened.", "大眼和纵瞳适应昏暗森林光线。交流方式了解很少；受威胁时会张开红色口腔并大声叫喊。"),
    seasonal: b("Egg laying begins around the start of the rainy season in month 11 (November). Otherwise, a detailed wild annual cycle is not established.", "产卵约在11月雨季开始时启动。除此之外，野外年度节律尚未被完整建立。"),
    humans: b("The dramatic name reflects appearance, not dangerous behavior. It is sensitive to handling and habitat conditions, so responsible interest should favor observation and verified captive-bred animals rather than wild collection.", "其夸张俗名来自外形，并不代表危险行为。它对抓握和环境条件敏感，负责任的兴趣应以观察和来源可核实的人工繁育个体为主，而非野捕。"),
    field: b("By day, inspect low dead leaves and thin branches for a still silhouette whose tail completes the leaf illusion. At night use minimal light, avoid touching vegetation around a detected animal and record the tail edge for identification.", "白天可在低处枯叶和细枝间寻找静止轮廓，尾巴会补全枯叶幻象。夜间应尽量少用灯，不触碰个体周围植被，并记录尾缘以供鉴定。"),
    trivia: [
      trivia("Its tail can mimic leaf veins, decay and missing pieces.", "它的尾能同时模仿叶脉、腐坏和残缺。"),
      trivia("It usually stays within roughly 3 m of the forest floor.", "它通常不会离森林地面超过约3米。"),
      trivia("The accepted record has no recognized subspecies in the Reptile Database.", "爬行动物数据库中的接受记录没有承认亚种。", ["taxonomy"]),
    ],
    classModule: classSection("Gecko climbing and camouflage", "壁虎攀爬与伪装", "Adhesive toes keep the gecko secure on low vegetation while a flattened body and tail erase the usual lizard outline. Remaining motionless is as important as coloration.", "黏附趾使它稳固停在低矮植被上，扁平身体和尾则抹去常见蜥蜴轮廓；保持不动与颜色同样重要。"),
    map: [-20, 47.5], zoom: 5,
    polygons: [[[-14, 49.2], [-16.5, 49.6], [-20.5, 48.6], [-25.3, 47.2], [-25, 46], [-21, 47.2], [-17, 48.5], [-14, 49.2]]],
