    classModule: classSection("Incomplete metamorphosis", "不完全变态", "Treehoppers develop from egg through several nymphal instars to a winged adult without a pupal stage. Species-specific timing for B. globulare is still a research gap.", "角蝉从卵经过数个若虫龄期成为有翅成虫，不经历蛹期；B. globulare各阶段的物种级时长仍是研究空白。"),
